d)
Consideration of Bid #E- 12-24 for multiple twenty (20) passenger buses for the
City of Cheyenne Transit Program, (Transit Program Funds)
Mr. White moved to accept the bid from Model I Commercial Vehicles, Inc., dba Creative Bus
Sales, Inc., in an amount not to exceed $1,661,767.40, seconded by Mr. Cook.
Motion carried
with Mr. White voting “YES”, Mr. Cook voting “NO”, and Chairwoman Aldrich breaking the tie,
voting “YES”.
